    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/729da1990edb861ae5c9425a028168f4.avif?t=1731084778\" /></div><br><br>Destroy friendships with this local and online multiplayer game for 1 to 12 players. You can create 3 fully customizable puppets, play many mini-games of precision, intelligence and reflexes. But watch out, your friends can totally end you<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your puppets and your pet!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/bbb723020db71e5e118dad5930210034.poster.avif?t=1731084778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/bbb723020db71e5e118dad5930210034.webm?t=1731084778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/bbb723020db71e5e118dad5930210034.mp4?t=1731084778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You can be your own team!</h2>Have you ever thought that you often lose because of your team? At the puppet party you can choose game modes that you control 3 puppets at once.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/7a8b2a82b629423896cbc36e85648cdf.poster.avif?t=1731084778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/7a8b2a82b629423896cbc36e85648cdf.webm?t=1731084778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/7a8b2a82b629423896cbc36e85648cdf.mp4?t=1731084778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/729da1990edb861ae5c9425a028168f4.avif?t=1731084778\" /></div><br><br>Destroy friendships with this local and online multiplayer game for 1 to 12 players. You can create 3 fully customizable puppets, play many mini-games of precision, intelligence and reflexes. But watch out, your friends can totally end you<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your puppets and your pet!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/bbb723020db71e5e118dad5930210034.poster.avif?t=1731084778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/bbb723020db71e5e118dad5930210034.webm?t=1731084778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/bbb723020db71e5e118dad5930210034.mp4?t=1731084778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You can be your own team!</h2>Have you ever thought that you often lose because of your team? At the puppet party you can choose game modes that you control 3 puppets at once.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/7a8b2a82b629423896cbc36e85648cdf.poster.avif?t=1731084778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/7a8b2a82b629423896cbc36e85648cdf.webm?t=1731084778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431910/extras/7a8b2a82b629423896cbc36e85648cdf.mp4?t=1731084778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
